{"3711840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Dying Mind", "steam_appid": 3711840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Dying Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dying Mind</strong> (previously known as &quot;Rebirth&quot;) is an emotional, story-driven 2D platformer metroidvania set inside the fractured mind of a young writer named Mark, suspended between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragic accident, Mark becomes trapped in a surreal inner world shaped by his memories, fears, and regrets. As doctors in the real-world debate whether to keep him alive, time is running out. To survive, Mark must confront the monsters born from his trauma, uncover forgotten memories, and fight his way toward awakening.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Dreamlike World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through multiple hand-crafted environments inspired by Mark’s past, from peaceful meadows to abandoned villages and towering monuments of memory. Each area reveals new fragments of his story and challenges his resolve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/eaaffbdc47a6243a614083ba097f97dd.poster.avif?t=1782508907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/eaaffbdc47a6243a614083ba097f97dd.webm?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/eaaffbdc47a6243a614083ba097f97dd.mp4?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in Epic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your sword against hostile creatures and powerful bosses that embody Mark’s inner struggles. Learn enemy patterns, master movement, and survive intense encounters that test your reflexes and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/58f9d2a516847e4d1ac164ccd6d06ae4.poster.avif?t=1782508907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/58f9d2a516847e4d1ac164ccd6d06ae4.webm?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/58f9d2a516847e4d1ac164ccd6d06ae4.mp4?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a Narrative-Focused Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth blends gameplay and storytelling through environmental details, cutscenes, and symbolic encounters. Every level brings you closer to understanding Mark’s life, his regrets, and what it truly means to move forward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/b9cbad3603540b1bf1948f01b6a7138d.poster.avif?t=1782508907\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/b9cbad3603540b1bf1948f01b6a7138d.webm?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/b9cbad3603540b1bf1948f01b6a7138d.mp4?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven 2D action-adventure experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted levels with unique visual styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword-based combat with challenging enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional narrative exploring memory, loss, and hope</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign focused on immersion and discovery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Mark find the strength to awaken, or will his story end inside his own mind?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Dying Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dying Mind</strong> (previously known as &quot;Rebirth&quot;) is an emotional, story-driven 2D platformer metroidvania set inside the fractured mind of a young writer named Mark, suspended between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragic accident, Mark becomes trapped in a surreal inner world shaped by his memories, fears, and regrets. As doctors in the real-world debate whether to keep him alive, time is running out. To survive, Mark must confront the monsters born from his trauma, uncover forgotten memories, and fight his way toward awakening.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Dreamlike World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through multiple hand-crafted environments inspired by Mark’s past, from peaceful meadows to abandoned villages and towering monuments of memory. Each area reveals new fragments of his story and challenges his resolve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/eaaffbdc47a6243a614083ba097f97dd.poster.avif?t=1782508907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/eaaffbdc47a6243a614083ba097f97dd.webm?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/eaaffbdc47a6243a614083ba097f97dd.mp4?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in Epic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your sword against hostile creatures and powerful bosses that embody Mark’s inner struggles. Learn enemy patterns, master movement, and survive intense encounters that test your reflexes and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/58f9d2a516847e4d1ac164ccd6d06ae4.poster.avif?t=1782508907\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/58f9d2a516847e4d1ac164ccd6d06ae4.webm?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/58f9d2a516847e4d1ac164ccd6d06ae4.mp4?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a Narrative-Focused Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth blends gameplay and storytelling through environmental details, cutscenes, and symbolic encounters. Every level brings you closer to understanding Mark’s life, his regrets, and what it truly means to move forward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/b9cbad3603540b1bf1948f01b6a7138d.poster.avif?t=1782508907\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/b9cbad3603540b1bf1948f01b6a7138d.webm?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/extras/b9cbad3603540b1bf1948f01b6a7138d.mp4?t=1782508907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven 2D action-adventure experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted levels with unique visual styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword-based combat with challenging enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional narrative exploring memory, loss, and hope</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign focused on immersion and discovery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Mark find the strength to awaken, or will his story end inside his own mind?</p>", "short_description": "The Dying Mind is a story-driven 2D metroidvania where you explore the fractured mind of a young writer, battle symbolic enemies, and uncover lost memories in a race between life and death.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/ed28a4f78ea6112903232dc4994b8270c23f382d/header.jpg?t=1782508907", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/b517a42108fd4348d847d74f0b4cb354111d8eda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782508907", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711840/b517a42108fd4348d847d74f0b4cb354111d8eda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782508907", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 / AMD Radeon HD 7850 / Intel HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Designed for keyboard and mouse. Gamepad support optional.</li